\textbf{2.2 Optimization}

The overall setting, which can be seen as a discrete auto-encoder,
cannot be differentiated directly, as the latent space is discrete. We
use a hybrid optimization between REINFORCE for Speaker (Williams, 1992)
and classic back-propagation for Listener (Schulman et al., 2015).
\end{quote}

and \emph{L}(\emph{m}) the output distribution of Listener that takes
